1.2 - 2026-07-14
================

- Fix decoding of H.264 videos with multi-slice frames
- Fix compatibility with mpv --vo=gpu (mpv returns buffers that are
  still in use - being sampled by GPU at the time of return)
- Add tracing code for performance analysis

Tested platforms are currently: Allwinner A64, H3. Rockchip RK3399
and RK3588. Only RK3588 comes with some VA-API imposed limitations,
but still has working AV1 acceleration.

This project is now useful enough for a wider distribution to users.


1.1 - 2026-07-13
================

- Fix support for cedrus / Alwinner A64 SoC
